# Security-header posture for the pay.xend.global static host (ADR 0016).
# Served by the CDN deploy target (Cloudflare Pages / Netlify _headers). If the
# surface is ever fronted by a different host, apply this identical header set there.
# Ownership note: ADR 0012 governs the backend API origin's CORS/COOP; this file
# governs the checkout static host only. The two must not be conflated.
/*
  Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy: same-origin-allow-popups
  Content-Security-Policy: frame-ancestors 'none'
  X-Frame-Options: DENY
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: no-referrer
